+              <button type="button" class="btn-action btn-secondary btn-sm js-tamper-btn">🛡️ Test GCM Tamper Detection</button>
+              <button type="button" class="btn-action btn-secondary btn-sm js-inspect-btn">🔍 Inspect Envelope</button>
